          255,
          1
        ],
        "fontSize": "13px",
        "fontWeight": "400"
      },
      {
        "measurement": "unmeasured-background-image-or-opacity",
        "text": "李梦的作答：",
        "tag": "STRONG",
        "class": "",
        "ratio": 10.212,
        "required": 4.5,
        "color": "rgb(52, 66, 85)",
        "background": [
          255,
          255,
          255,
          1
        ],
        "fontSize": "13px",
        "fontWeight": "700"
      },
      {
        "measurement": "unmeasured-background-image-or-opacity",
        "text": "一、角色间冲突。个体的不同身份之间可能存在要求上的矛盾。例如，在学习安排与团队责任发生冲突时，需要协调时间与任务优先级。",
        "tag": "P",
        "class": "",
        "ratio": 10.212,
        "required": 4.5,
        "color": "rgb(52, 66, 85)",
        "background": [
          255,
          255,
          255,
          1
        ],
        "fontSize": "13px",
        "fontWeight": "400"
      },
      {
        "measurement": "unmeasured-background-image-or-opacity",
        "text": "二、角色内冲突。同一个角色也可能同时面对不同对象的期待。分析时，需要说明这些期待各自的来源与适用条件。",
        "tag": "P",
        "class": "",
        "ratio": 10.212,
        "required": 4.5,
        "color": "rgb(52, 66, 85)",
        "background": [
          255,
          255,
          255,
          1
        ],
        "fontSize": "13px",
        "fontWeight": "400"
      },
      {
        "measurement": "unmeasured-background-image-or-opacity",
        "text": "综上，应当先界定对象与关系，再明确冲突发生的具体条件。",
